    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Reclassification events",
      "description": "This is the only misclassification-correction signal visible in gateway_output telemetry: turns where a memory-recall cue pattern overrode the initial classification (signals contains recall_cue_reclassified), broken down by the corrected task_type. Rare -- 5 of 1696 turns (0.3%) over the full 90d/77-day emission history, all on 2026-05-10, all corrected to memory_recall. A separate recall_controller_skipped event (503 docs, out of scope here) logs the recall controller's decision-not-to-override cases with an original_task_type field, offering a richer decision-log for this subsystem if a deeper investigation is warranted later.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 32
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "elasticsearch",
        "uid": "es-agent-logs"
      },
      "targets": [
